<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:24px; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:700; color:#111110;">Confirm your subscription</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#3D3D3A;">You asked to get new posts from <strong style="color:#111110;"><%= @username %></strong> by email. One click confirms it.</p>

<p style="margin:24px 0 28px;">
  <a href="<%= confirm_subscription_url(@username, @token) %>" style="display:inline-block; background:#111110; color:#F3F3F1; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:12px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">Confirm subscription</a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#72726D;">Didn’t ask for this? Ignore this email and nothing happens.</p>
